OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty morning, feeling cold  
OL,6,Fthroughout the day despite the long    
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Shaded areas may stay    
OL,8,Ffrosty or icy throughout the day,      
OL,9,Fparticularly within the valleys of     
OL,10,FCumbria. Becoming breezy in the        
OL,11,Fafternoon.                             
OL,13,CTonight:FA breezy night with           
OL,14,Fthickening cloud. Feeling cold, but    
OL,15,Fwithout the risk of frost for coasts   
OL,16,Fand cities. Further inland,            
OL,17,Fparticularly for the fells, another    
OL,18,Ffrosty night.                          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
